## 🔒 Data Protection (121XML Systems)

Every operation protected by:

### Content Addressing
- SHA256 immutable addresses
- Deterministic (same data = same address)
- Collision-free (256-bit security)
- Enables perfect deduplication

### Lossless Compression
- 90-96% token reduction
- **0% data loss** (guaranteed)
- Full data archived
- Perfect reconstruction anytime

### Persistence Layer
- Content-addressed storage
- Type-based indexing
- Query capabilities
- Archive system

### Audit Trail
- Immutable operation log
- Complete reconstruction proof
- All transformations tracked
- Zero information loss

